r handling capacity. Heavy copper ring below the T-shaped pole piece will reduce non linear and modulation distortion. Bullet shaped phase plug reduces compression due to temperature variations in the voice coil, avoids resonance problems which would occur in the volume between the dust cap and the pole piece and increases the long term power handling capacity. Extremely stiff and stable injection moulded metal basket, keeps the critical compo- nents in perfect alignment. Large windows in the basket both above and below the spider reduce sound reflection, air flow noise and cavity resonance to a minimum.","read_precision":0.005,"read_value":0.29}},"state":"E","value":0.29},"Re_ohm":{"corroboration":"UNMATCHED","dq_calculated":[],"dq_scraper":[],"origin":"manufacturer_datasheet","readings":{"manufacturer_datasheet":{"actual_reading":"6.0 Ohms","read_precision":0.05,"read_value":6}},"state":"E","value":6},"Rme_kg_per_s":{"dq_calculated":[],"state":"C","value":10.611191186419171},"Rms_kg_per_s":{"corroboration":"UNMATCHED","dq_calculated":[],"dq_scraper":[],"origin":"manufacturer_datasheet","readings":{"manufacturer_datasheet":{"actual_reading":"2.1 Ns/m","read_precision":0.05,"read_value":2.1}},"state":"E","value":2.1},"SPL_dB":{"corroboration":"UNMATCHED","dq_calculated":[],"dq_scraper":[],"origin":"manufacturer_datasheet","readings":{"manufacturer_datasheet":{"actual_reading":"90.5 dB","note":"2.83V/1m","read_precision":0.05,"read_value":90.5}},"state":"E","value":90.5},"SPLmaxLF_dB":{"dq_calculated":[],"state":"C","value":79.45413696529076},"SPLmax_dB":{"dq_calculated":[],"state":"C","value":107.5},"Sd_m2":{"corroboration":"UNMATCHED","dq_calculated":[{"detail":"Vas_m3, Cms_m_per_N, Sd_m2, roo_kg_per_m3, c_m_per_s disagree by 7.9%: Vas = ρ·c²·Sd²·Cms. Every field in the group is marked - correct one of them, or clear one to let it be calculated.","kind":"calc","params":{"actual":0.103,"expected":0.116718294,"fields":["Vas_m3","Cms_m_per_N","Sd_m2","roo_kg_per_m3","